   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRISH AID SUPPORT FOR HALO TRUST CAMBODIA CONTRACT: UXO PROGRAMME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce casualties and fatalities through the clearance of the minefields, respond to reports of explosive remnants of war (ERW) and provide Explosive Ordnance Risk Education (EORE) to communities exposed to landmines and ERW. The project will also contribute to the alleviation of poverty through making safe land available to communities for cultivation, and allow sustainable development where land is returned to communities.</narrative>
  </description>
